Climate change topped the list of global concerns in a [2016 World Economic Forum study](https://www.businessinsider.com/world-economic-forum-world-biggest-problems-concerning-millennials-2016-8) that asked 26,000 millennials from 181 countries to identify the three most serious problems facing humanity — 45% of those surveyed included it in their responses.  
