## Story of a plan change

![Jungwon Byun portrait]()

#### Jungwon Byun

Jungwon spent years working in financial services before she became interested in the transformative potential — and risks — of advanced AI. She realised her highest-impact path might lie in using AI to enhance human knowledge and decision making, and in 2019, she cofounded [Ought](https://ought.org/): a research lab dedicated to scaling up good reasoning. In the same year, she came across the 80,000 Hours website and [podcast](https://80000hours.org/podcast/), which helped her quickly ramp up her understanding of AI safety and existential risk.

Jungwon is now the COO of [Elicit](https://elicit.com/), an AI research tool launched by Ought that later spun out as a public benefit corporation. She has helped millions of researchers understand the world and reason more effectively.

